  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me—what do you seek strength for?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D00652014007700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020007300650065006B00200073007400720065006E00670074006800200066006F0072003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For me. Only me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F00720020006D0065002E0020004F006E006C00790020006D0065002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I pursue strength in order to protect Gwynn and\nothers I hold dear. A fine reason, no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm. It’s true that I still haven’t beaten Jacinthe, so\nmy way might not be paying off yet.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But all this stuff I’m going through now is gonna\nmake me stronger in the end. I know it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once I defeat Jacinthe, I’m pretty sure I’ll never\nlose to anyone else ever again. So I’ll keep on<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfighting until that happens.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So you do indeed fight only for your own sake.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200079006F007500200064006F00200069006E00640065006500640020006600690067006800740020006F006E006C007900200066006F007200200079006F007500720020006F0077006E002000730061006B0065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Does that attitude truly befit a Pokémon Trainer?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00650073002000740068006100740020006100740074006900740075006400650020007400720075006C00790020006200650066006900740020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200054007200610069006E00650072003F002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You. Come here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002E00200043006F006D006500200068006500720065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m going to use you to settle their squabble.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200067006F0069006E006700200074006F002000750073006500200079006F007500200074006F00200073006500740074006C00650020007400680065006900720020007300710075006100620062006C0065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey. <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>’s here.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNow we can all battle and settle who’s right\nalready.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready for battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900200066006F007200200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Give me a minute",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069007600650020006D0065002000610020006D0069006E0075007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you wanna get stronger, you better back up\nyour talk with action!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F0075002000770061006E006E006100200067006500740020007300740072006F006E006700650072002C00200079006F007500200062006500740074006500720020006200610063006B002000750070000A0079006F00750072002000740061006C006B0020007700690074006800200061006300740069006F006E002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Help me prove that my way is right,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLet’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbeat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFist<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof Justice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I, too, desire battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002C00200074006F006F002C002000640065007300690072006500200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s battle so I can go home.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500200073006F00200049002000630061006E00200067006F00200068006F006D0065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready for battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900200066006F007200200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Give me a minute",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069007600650020006D0065002000610020006D0069006E0075007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are places in life you cannot reach without\nclimbing over strong opponents to get there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Strength is power!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400720065006E00670074006800200069007300200070006F007700650072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I took you for someone more decisive.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200074006F006F006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200073006F006D0065006F006E00650020006D006F00720065002000640065006300690073006900760065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Strength is justice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400720065006E0067007400680020006900730020006A007500730074006900630065002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Help me prove that my way is right,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLet’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbeat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFist<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof Justice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time to Mega Evolve, Falinks! Justice WILL win\nthe day!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006D006500200074006F0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C00760065002C002000460061006C0069006E006B007300210020004A007500730074006900630065002000570049004C004C002000770069006E000A0074006800650020006400610079002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chandelure... Mega Evolve. Finish them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E002E002E0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C00760065002E002000460069006E0069007300680020007400680065006D002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time for our secret weapon! Mega Evolve so we\ncan drag these two, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps there is nothing nobler or better about\nfighting for others versus for yourself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I shouldn’t have made it into a matter of morals.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000730068006F0075006C0064006E20190074002000680061007600650020006D00610064006500200069007400200069006E0074006F002000610020006D006100740074006500720020006F00660020006D006F00720061006C0073002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, maybe. But protecting others is a noble\ncause, and I can tell it brings you peace of mind!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your words and our battle have moved me. Please,\nlet me offer you the uniform of our dojo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry. I’m sworn to keep this uniform on until I\nwin my way free of Jacinthe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Understood. Then once again, I shall donate the\noutfit to you, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00640065007200730074006F006F0064002E0020005400680065006E0020006F006E0063006500200061006700610069006E002C002000490020007300680061006C006C00200064006F006E0061007400650020007400680065000A006F0075007400660069007400200074006F00200079006F0075002C00200010000201000000002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received additional color options for\nIvor’s Gi Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020006100640064006900740069006F006E0061006C00200063006F006C006F00720020006F007000740069006F006E007300200066006F0072000A00490076006F007220190073002000470069002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hear the true oddballs out there will even copy\nIvor’s hairstyle to go with the gi set.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The path to strength has no end. Let us battle\nagain if ever an opportunity arises!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In a way, Lebanne might be better suited to our\ndojo than I am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E002000610020007700610079002C0020004C006500620061006E006E00650020006D00690067006800740020006200650020006200650074007400650072002000730075006900740065006400200074006F0020006F00750072000A0064006F006A006F0020007400680061006E0020004900200061006D002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I feel like Ivor and I might’ve duked it out in the\nfighting ring when we were kids...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    }
